---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /guides/
title: Hackathon guides
description: Practical guides for every stage of a hackathon, from choosing an event and forming a team to pitching, judging and what to do afterwards.
---
<h1>Guides</h1>
<p class="muted">Short, practical guides for each stage of a hackathon. Event pages suggest the ones that fit where you are.</p>
{%- if not guides.anyFinal %}
<p class="notice">These guides are drafts awaiting editorial review.</p>
{%- endif %}
{%- for stage in guides.stages %}{% if stage.guides.length %}
<h2>{{ stage.name }}</h2>
<ul class="guide-list">
  {%- for g in stage.guides %}
  <li><a href="{{ g.url }}">{{ g.title }}</a>{% if g.draft %} <span class="badge badge-ended">Draft</span>{% endif %}<span class="sub">{{ g.description }}</span></li>
  {%- endfor %}
</ul>
{%- endif %}{% endfor %}
